  {
    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/1h0lde4/ocbrain-v4.1/pulls/83",
    "id": 4885711690,
    "node_id": "PR_kwDOSWs39c8AAAABIzYLSg",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/1h0lde4/ocbrain-v4.1/pull/83",
    "diff_url": "https://github.com/1h0lde4/ocbrain-v4.1/pull/83.diff",
    "patch_url": "https://github.com/1h0lde4/ocbrain-v4.1/pull/83.patch",
    "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/1h0lde4/ocbrain-v4.1/issues/83",
    "number": 83,
    "state": "open",
    "locked": false,
    "title": "docs: record FZ-D1/FZ-D2 decisions and FZ-02 residuals",
    "user": {
      "login": "1h0lde4",
      "id": 196927701,
      "node_id": "U_kgDOC7zg1Q",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196927701?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/1h0lde4",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/following{/other_user}",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/gists{/gist_id}",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/events{/privacy}",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "body": "## Scope\n\nDocumentation-only reconciliation of `KNOWN_ISSUES.md` against the merged FZ-02 batches and the owner-confirmed decisions.\n\n- Records FZ-D1=(a): preserve `handle() -> str` and expose an internal structured result to the API.\n- Records FZ-D2=(i): stalled/hard-deadline outcomes are failures; partial text remains in `metadata[\"partial_output\"]`.\n- Separates decisions from implementation status. FZ-01 remains open pending implementation; FZ-02 is implemented and verified only for provider-failure and stalled/deadline classes.\n- Explicitly records that `EMPTY_RESPONSE` and `COMPLETED_WITH_PARTIAL_OUTPUT` are not accepted as success contracts and remain open residuals.\n\nNo code, runtime contract, or freeze verdict is changed. The original Oct 1 audit remains the baseline-specific verdict source; recover its full criteria before rendering any new verdict.",
    "created_at": "2026-10-16T08:36:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-02T11:23:27Z",
