    "body": "## What\n\nRecords the **D11 closure evidence** in reconciliation §19.1, as the ruled sequence requires after the D11 fix (PR #68, `f544afd`) and the D7 test fix (PR #64, `0411e6c`) were merged. Documentation only, one file. The reopening (DEFECT IDENTIFIED) stays in the record; D11 returns to PASS on the evidence listed in §19.1; the §18 tally is again 22 PASS, 1 FAIL, 3 BLOCKED, 1 UNVERIFIED, 1 EXCEPTION ACCEPTED = 28 (checked by parsing the matrix); Result 2 and the Stage 5 decision are unchanged.\n\nThe §19.1 closure text states its limits: one load profile on one 1-core host (36 runs), no full-suite run under load, a verdict about the classification race rather than every possible interleaving.\n\n## Merging\n\nMerge commit. After this merge the B01 base branch is created from the resulting tip; `core/` and `tests/` there are byte-identical to the validated tree of `0411e6c` (only this document differs).\n",
    "created_at": "2026-10-07T14:15:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-07T14:15:29Z",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-07T14:15:28Z",
