    "html_url": "https://github.com/1h0lde4/ocbrain-v4.1/pull/60",
    "diff_url": "https://github.com/1h0lde4/ocbrain-v4.1/pull/60.diff",
    "patch_url": "https://github.com/1h0lde4/ocbrain-v4.1/pull/60.patch",
    "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/1h0lde4/ocbrain-v4.1/issues/60",
    "number": 60,
    "state": "closed",
    "locked": false,
    "title": "B00: sync main into sandbox-fabric before the sandbox-network-isolation workstream",
    "user": {
      "login": "1h0lde4",
      "id": 196927701,
      "node_id": "U_kgDOC7zg1Q",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196927701?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/1h0lde4",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/following{/other_user}",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/gists{/gist_id}",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/events{/privacy}",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "body": "## What\n\n**B00 of the `sandbox-network-isolation` workstream:** merges `main` (`7464a84`) into `sandbox-fabric` (`b895445`, after PR #50) so that the implementation base carries the synchronized `main`. Merge commit only; no other change.\n\n## Evidence (checked before this PR was opened)\n\n- **0 conflicts.** 50 files change; **none is under the sandbox workstream's paths** (`core/sandbox/`, `tests/core/sandbox/`, `docs/architecture/sandbox*`, `handoff.md`). Verified by `git diff --name-only origin/sandbox-fabric <this branch>`.\n- **Tree hash `6848e1a0c3c7059a81fe2e54de9220b8c2241d85`** equals the tree of a throwaway dry-run done earlier, so the earlier results apply to this exact tree; they were also re-run on this checkout.\n- **Architecture drift check:** 15 of 15 pass (this checkout, and the dry run).\n- **Sandbox suite (`tests/core/sandbox`):** the dry run passed 147/147 and 15 standalone `test_net_proxy.py` runs passed. **On this checkout one test failed once: `test_d7_cancel_reaches_a_grandchild_that_was_provably_alive_before`** (146 passed, 1 failed). It is a pre-existing, test-side race and not caused by this merge (details below).\n- `KNOWN_ISSUES.md` on the merged tree has the DEBT-021 (explicitly incomplete), DEBT-039, DEBT-040 and DEBT-041 rows.\n\n## The one test failure (disclosed, investigated, not hidden)\n\n- **Mechanism (measured):** the grandchild writes its heartbeat with `date +%s%N > /workspace/heartbeat`, which truncates the file before writing. A host-side read can land in that gap and see an empty file. Measured on this host with the test's own writer: **12,987 empty reads out of 1,621,719 (about 0.8% of the time the file is empty)**. The test's vacuity guard then fires (\"the grandchild was not alive and advancing\"); the captured failure had `before_2 == ''`.\n- **Not caused by the sync:** this PR changes no file under `core/sandbox/` or `tests/core/sandbox/` (see above). The same test file and code run on `sandbox-fabric` before the merge.\n- **Observed rates:** 1 failure in 147-test suite run; 1 of 12 standalone on this checkout, then 0 of 30; 0 of 20 on the pre-sync tip. Consistent with a roughly 1% per-run flake.\n- **Classification:** test-side implementation failure (a read race), not a product defect and not an environmental excuse. It is **not** added to any known-failures list. A separate, small fix PR (atomic write or a retry on an empty read, after checking the other heartbeat tests) is proposed and not part of this PR.\n\n## Merging\n\n- **Use a merge commit. Do not squash or rebase**: this is a sync of `main`, and squashing would drop `main`'s history from `sandbox-fabric` and make the next sync conflict.\n- No CI `tests` job runs for PRs into `sandbox-fabric` (workflows trigger only for PRs to `main`), so the evidence above is local. It is recorded here and will be copied into the reconciliation document's evidence record (OD-6) when B00 is closed.\n- **Not merged. Merging needs an explicit instruction.** After the merge, B00 step 3 creates the B01 base branch under `sandbox-network-isolation`.\n",
    "created_at": "2026-10-05T16:25:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-06T00:31:37Z",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-06T00:31:36Z",
