    "body": "Documentation only. Records the **verified** post-#46 / post-#56 state in `KNOWN_ISSUES.md` and `CURRENT_STATE.md`, as a separate narrow PR after the code work reached a definitive state.\n\n**Owner:** @1h0lde4. **Base:** `main` @ `41fa85a`.\n\n## What changed (all insertions inside existing rows, plus one new sync entry per file)\n- `KNOWN_ISSUES.md`: new top sync entry (previous top demoted verbatim with the existing `Prior sync ` convention); **DEBT-019** gets a CTX-EXPORT-001 addendum (the `/import` boundary, its behavior change, what stays open); **DEBT-038** gets an addendum superseding its Oct 2 `/import` classification and open-alert count, with the `learning/*` call paths re-traced on current `main`.\n- `CURRENT_STATE.md`: matching sync entry; CTX-EXPORT-001 row updated.\n\n## Facts recorded (each read back from GitHub, not inferred)\n- PR #46 merge `a21711e`: fresh CodeQL analysis of `main` there = 28 of 29 `py/path-injection` alerts `fixed`, #12 still open.\n- PR #56 merge `41fa85a`: fresh analysis of `main` there (Oct 5, 07:31Z) = #12 `fixed`, **0 open alerts**; 34 fixed in total; the 4 alerts dismissed Oct 2 by 1h0lde4 are unchanged.\n- #44 closed unmerged as superseded; decisions D1-D5 live in issue #54.\n- Behavior change stated explicitly: both import routes refuse until `global.import_root` is set.\n\n## Deliberately not changed\n- **CTX-EXPORT-001 stays open** (signature/checksum/content validation, freeze classification, TOCTOU window).\n- The `PlannerWorker` leak and DEBT-032 are separate workstreams and are untouched.\n- No severity or ownership of any register entry was changed.\n- \"Fixed\" is stated as CodeQL's verdict, not proof of guard sufficiency; the behavioral evidence is cited separately.\n\n## Verification\nPure insertions in the three edited table rows (pipe counts unchanged), previous top entries preserved verbatim, both files pure LF, `scripts/check_drift.py` passes all 15 rules locally.\n\nNot merged; awaiting the required checks.\n",
