  {
    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/1h0lde4/ocbrain-v4.1/pulls/56",
    "id": 4737725709,
    "node_id": "PR_kwDOSWs39c8AAAABGmP1DQ",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/1h0lde4/ocbrain-v4.1/pull/56",
    "diff_url": "https://github.com/1h0lde4/ocbrain-v4.1/pull/56.diff",
    "patch_url": "https://github.com/1h0lde4/ocbrain-v4.1/pull/56.patch",
    "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/1h0lde4/ocbrain-v4.1/issues/56",
    "number": 56,
    "state": "closed",
    "locked": false,
    "title": "fix(import): confine /import bundle_path to a configured import root (issue #54, CodeQL #12)",
    "user": {
      "login": "1h0lde4",
      "id": 196927701,
      "node_id": "U_kgDOC7zg1Q",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196927701?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/1h0lde4",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/following{/other_user}",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/gists{/gist_id}",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/events{/privacy}",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/1h0lde4/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "body": "Implements #54 (supersedes #44): confine `/import` and `/brain/v2/import` `bundle_path` to a configured import root. Targets CodeQL alert **#12** (`py/path-injection`, `core/brain_export.py:181` on `main`). **Not merge-ready until a fresh CodeQL analysis of the final commit is reviewed.**\n\n**Owner:** @1h0lde4. **Baseline:** `main` @ `80a1bb8` (branch is textually clean against current `main`).\n\n## Accepted decisions (recorded in #54 before implementation)\nD1 no configured root => refuse (no `data/exports` fallback) - D2 relative path is relative to the root, never the CWD - D3 `.ocbrain` suffix required - D4 containment uses the shape proven in #46 (`os.path.realpath` strings + `startswith(root + os.sep)`), not #44's `resolve()`/`is_relative_to()` - D5 the suffix is defense in depth, not the containment proof.\n\n## Commits\n1. `4934f91` `style:` LF normalization of `core/brain_export.py` and `core/brain_api.py` (owner request). **Mechanical**: blobs equal the base with CR bytes stripped; `git diff --ignore-cr-at-eol` against the base is empty.\n2. `6dee2b2` `fix(import):` the functional change (7 files, +528/-8).\n\n## Behavior change\nBoth import routes **refuse until `global.import_root` is set** (HTTP 400, fixed text that echoes neither the input nor the root). Containment is checked before existence, so there is no existence oracle outside the root. `FileNotFoundError` handling is unchanged.\n\n## Evidence so far (local)\n- Targeted security/import tests: 201 passed, 4 skipped on Python 3.11.15, 3.12.3, 3.13.13, 3.14.4.\n- Full suite: 8 failed, 1876 passed, 4 skipped, 1 xfailed; failing set identical to pristine `80a1bb8` (8 `chromadb` import failures in the sandbox; baseline 1813 passed, delta = the 63 new tests).\n- Mutation checks: 10 targeted mutants (naive prefix, no containment, no suffix, CWD-relative, implicit fallback, no symlink resolution, existence-before-containment, root accepted, suffix on requested name, unmapped 400), all caught.\n- Four existing tests that kept bundles in temp dirs now configure a root; one `ValueError` assertion was tightened so the new boundary cannot satisfy it by accident.\n\n## Not claimed\n- **CodeQL:** no analysis of this commit exists yet; #12 stays open and nothing is dismissed. It counts as fixed only if a fresh analysis of the final commit no longer reports it and reports no equivalent/new path-injection findings; #12 on `main` closes only after merge and a fresh `main` analysis.\n- Not addressed (out of scope): TOCTOU between the check and the later `ZipFile` open; bundle signature/checksum.\n\nRefs #54\n",
    "created_at": "2026-10-04T21:23:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-05T07:29:58Z",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-05T07:29:57Z",
