    "body": "Performed a comprehensive audit of all open issues, active technical debt, and security findings (REM-004, CTX-EXPORT-001, DEBT-024, DEBT-025, DEBT-027, DEBT-028, DEBT-002, DEBT-007) against the OCBrain Kernel Constitution and v1.0 Freeze Criteria. Verified that all core kernel blockers are closed and remaining items are non-blocking Tier 3 debt or application-layer concerns.\n\n---\n*PR created automatically by Jules for task [486744888107768061](https://jules.google.com/task/486744888107768061) started by @1h0lde4*",
