    "body": "Documentation-only pass on `docs/architecture/WORKSPACE_ARCHITECTURE.md`. No production code, tests, schemas, or kernel behavior touched.\n\n**Baseline:** doc was written against `aae1310`; live `main` is `c67187a`. Clean fast-forward, revalidated. All §W.4 REPO FACT line citations re-verified at the exact lines cited.\n\n### Contradictions eliminated\n- **Event vs Observation** — \"All state changes are events before projections\" removed from §O.1 and Invariant 14.\n- **Command lifecycle** — `Accepted` no longer means \"Validated\" while `Validating` follows it.\n- **UI read path** — \"All UI reads are served from projections\" contradicted §E.1's direct-query domains. Reads now classified projection-backed / authoritative-source-backed / hybrid.\n\n### Findings recorded, not invented\n- **§O.1.1 — domain mutation / EventStream atomicity is OPEN.** `SQLiteEventStore._append_sync()` opens its own connection and commits independently; zero outbox/2pc in `core/`. No atomic mechanism exists.\n- **§G.4 fail-closed** — governor exceptions already convert to `REJECT` (REPO FACT). Missing-principal and scope-indeterminate cases marked OPEN (no Principal system — DEBT-025).\n- **§B.6 — `core/workspace/domain.py` conformance audit.** Landed at `69375c9`, unwired, untested, anchored to the SUPERSEDED predecessor. 11 gaps against NORMATIVE sections. Code not modified; recorded as Open Decision #19.\n- **§B.3** — CTX-EXPORT-001 added to the blocker table (partially fixed at `e41a820`; freeze classification explicitly unresolved).\n\n### Decisions needed (Moncif)\n1. **#12** domain mutation / EventStream atomicity mechanism — P0, gates the persistence layer.\n2. **#19** `core/workspace/domain.py` disposition — rework to conform, documented exception, or remove.\n3. **#20** CTX-EXPORT-001 freeze classification.\n\nOpen Decisions 11 → 20. Decision Ledger 25 → 38. Bidirectional coverage audit added; twelve previously-unconsolidated predecessor sections landed. Exactly one authoritative Workspace architecture document remains.",
    "created_at": "2026-09-16T15:30:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-28T10:53:21Z",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-17T19:21:49Z",
