    "body": "Sept 15, 2026 freeze-classification pass. Verified by direct test execution rather than re-cited from prior text: TestCtxAuth001StructuralContainment passes (001a closed); TestCtxAuth001ParserAcceptance fails (001b open), reproducing an injected candidate accepted with no distinguishing signal. No AuthorityLevel type exists anywhere on any branch; REM-004 not started. security/freeze-reconciliation-sep2026 checked and ruled out as stale. CTX-EXPORT-001 freeze classification made explicit rather than inherited from the register Tier-3 language. Explicit decision: no stopgap authority field added just to pass the test. Docs + one test-file comment only, no runtime code changed.",
    "created_at": "2026-09-15T20:32:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-28T10:53:21Z",
