    "body": "Records Moncif's explicit decision on `fix/debt-020-completion-semantics-sep2026`: main's implementation stays canonical, the branch is superseded (not deleted, not reconciled), `CompletionStatus`/`has_checkable_value()` are explicitly not being ported without a fresh architectural need, and the remaining freeze-relevant question narrows to CTX-AUTH-001b. Direct transcription of his message, no new judgment calls in this diff.",
